<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe Rio Tinto yr shr, div slide.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe Rio Tinto yr shr, div slide.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)	   287    vs    1,005</p>
<p>    Div (cts)	   215    vs    590</p>
<p>    Pre-tax	   89.37    vs    219.56</p>
<p>    Tax		 24.92    vs    6.12</p>
<p>    After-tax	 64.44    vs    225.68</p>
<p>Div payable March 26</p>
<p>on register March 7</p>
<p>Full name: Rio Tinto Zimbabwe Ltd</p>
<p>Note - The company said that it had had a disappointing second half with difficulties encountered in bringing the new nickel refinery plant to the required production and efficiency levels.</p>
<p>Rio Tinto said that a more satisfactory contribution should be forthcoming from the refinery in 1997 with better operating parametres evident since the end of 1996.</p>
<p>It said that the decline in inflation should reduce the rate of cost increase, however the recent decline in the gold price and prospects for the price in the short-term would increase the pressure on margins.</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom +263-4 72 52 28/9</p>
